<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al Shabaab fighters are clashing with Turkish-trained Somali troops in Lower Shabelle and ambushing units near Baidoa. The former al-Shabaab finance chief was killed in a joint operation by Somali intelligence and security forces in Lower Shabelle. AU peacekeepers are withdrawing from four bases in Lower Shabelle while the UN political mission in Somalia has ended without a replacement to address the election dispute. Ethiopia has received Russian fighter jets with S‑400 systems slated to follow, and reports indicate UAE support for Houthis against Saudi-backed forces, while the conflict has caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNzdxT0hGaF8yc29NbWhvQWJvcXEyLXNPTVMtOE9sSTNDMEYyNXNfVXowTGJaaGdSbFNtNnR3ZjBTTGt5Ry1PQnNRbHlSWG9OZFprY0p3SXhUYzlTQ05HYjYxQmk0dnA3ZjcyOFVlb0Q1azItTVFja3ZEVFdYdFhQaTQyZDYyWW5nXzktMm43Y3dDQXBvekJxc0xMMkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE40U2xka1ZmVW04THNGQXczdTJyQ0M4MV9tVXJnenZ3c1VRUlV0dWt1a3Z0cFp0dTF2Wml2QVhMRkVMZE1hVzhDTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxONk5KTUNZVkdraWRiWDB3eVBmdGZVWjkyTGU5MEFQMXc0cmYwemhqelZBRTFWOWhpU0c3ak1LNHY0R1VCNU1wWWl2dWV1SVFSTUVoSVZFTFJjWW5pZUFuNTkwNjR0MFR4MTBnWkQ1UHlBOHFKRWxtWHYxdU43R0RwVVdzeHlrVUJITUx6YlZsU0xNeE9ScWRDTEZTSkJmZ2xJSE1wa2UyNHpRQ2JsOERId18wdE0zTmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPZnlsanJzSHdmYkpyV1VqaXNNSkt0Z18xUWV0bE5yd3JTb0RLR2NtcDhOemI3VENyb2pmZmhPekZoZldhaUJJOXlreUo0TUtBbWN0U21hN3N4WFduQXh4M0pIN25zU3BCZ21Ic3cxS1M5WlNJSFd5aTJnejhnU204SURCS1RwZlVpdzR3V3Y5TE1tbzl6emZ6bm13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot